        "target_value": "1.2 s",
        "by_date": "2026-07-15",
        "statement": "Checkout p95 is 2.4 s over the last 7 days against a 1.2 s target; 18 percent of mobile sessions abandon on the payment step, and the abandonment correlates with latency above 2 s."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "options",
      "value": [
        {
          "name": "precompute cart totals into the orders table (checkout_v2 behind a flag)",
